# Needs the load build: flutter build apk --debug --dart-define=PROBE_AGENT=true --dart-define=PROBE_FIXTURE_LOAD=true (see README).
# Reproduction for PT-25 (the agent connection drops, close 1006, under sustained background work). Fifteen cycles of an
# idle wait and a live check: about five minutes. Each wait stays under the 30 second step timeout.
test "sustained load keeps the agent connection"
  restart the app
  wait until "Load running" appears
  repeat 15 times
    wait 20 seconds
    see "Load running"
